<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{canonicalUrl}}">
    <meta name="description" content="{{description}}">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#102a43">
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Friends with Habits">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US">
    <meta property="og:url" content="{{canonicalUrl}}">
    <meta property="og:title" content="{{title}}">
    <meta property="og:description" content="{{description}}">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://habits.therr.com/assets/images/habits-og-image.png">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:site" content="@therr_app">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="{{title}}">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="{{description}}">
    <link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend:wght@400;600;800&display=swap">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/images/favicon-habits.ico">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/images/favicon-habits-32x32.png">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/images/favicon-habits-16x16.png">
    <style>
        :root {
            --habits-navy: #102a43;
            --habits-coral-dark: #e0521e;
            --habits-cream: #fff8f3;
            --habits-text: #243b53;
            --habits-text-muted: #627d98;
            --habits-border: #d9e2ec;
        }
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
        html, body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Lexend', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            color: var(--habits-text);
            background: var(--habits-cream);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        a { color: var(--habits-coral-dark); }
        .container { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
        header.site-header {
            padding: 1.25rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--habits-border);
            background: #fff;
        }
        header.site-header .container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.625rem;
        }
        header.site-header .brand-mark { width: 2rem; height: 2rem; display: block; }
        header.site-header .brand { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--habits-navy); }
        header.site-header a { color: var(--habits-navy); text-decoration: none; }
        main { padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--habits-navy); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .page-intro { color: var(--habits-text-muted); font-size: 1.0625rem; margin: 0 0 2.5rem; max-width: 34rem; }
        .post-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .post-list li { border-top: 1px solid var(--habits-border); padding: 1.75rem 0; }
        .post-list li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--habits-border); }
        .post-list h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.3; }
        .post-list h2 a { color: var(--habits-navy); text-decoration: none; }
        .post-list h2 a:hover, .post-list h2 a:focus-visible { color: var(--habits-coral-dark); text-decoration: underline; }
        .post-meta { color: var(--habits-text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
        .post-excerpt { margin: 0; color: var(--habits-text); }
        .cta-band {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding: 1.75rem;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--habits-border);
            border-radius: 0.75rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .cta-band p { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--habits-navy); }
        .cta-band a.cta {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--habits-coral-dark);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
        }
        a:focus-visible, .post-list h2 a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--habits-navy); outline-offset: 2px; }
        footer.site-footer {
            padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--habits-border);
            background: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--habits-text-muted);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }
        footer.site-footer .footer-links { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        footer.site-footer .footer-links a { margin: 0 0.5rem; color: var(--habits-text-muted); }
        footer.site-footer .footer-family { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    </style>
    {{> habitsAnalytics}}
</head>
<body>
    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="container">
            <img class="brand-mark" src="/assets/images/habits-logo.svg" width="32" height="32" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
            <a href="/" class="brand">Friends with Habits</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Notes on habits and accountability</h1>
            <p class="page-intro">Why habits stick when someone else is on the hook — and what the research on friendship, consistency and follow-through actually says.</p>

            <ul class="post-list">
                {{#each posts}}
                <li>
                    <h2><a href="/blog/{{this.slug}}">{{this.title}}</a></h2>
                    <p class="post-meta">{{this.dateDisplay}} · {{this.author}}</p>
                    <p class="post-excerpt">{{this.excerpt}}</p>
                </li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>

            <div class="cta-band">
                <p>Habits stick when a friend is on the hook too.</p>
                <a class="cta" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.therr.habits">Get Friends with Habits — free</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    {{> habitsFooter}}
</body>
</html>
